  "description": "Proposed replacement of existing planning permission, in order to extend time limit for implementation for planning permission 01135/34-38/P6 dated 01/11/2006 for the erection of new second floor extension to create a one bedroom flat at second floor level, and first and second floor rear extension to create staircase.",
